# program upgrade-authority keypairs (Task 0, week 2) — backup lives in a
# password manager, not git; see keys/README.md. `keys/*` (not `keys/`) so
# the negation below can still re-include the README — once a directory
# itself is excluded, git won't look inside it for `!`-negated files.
keys/*
!keys/README.md

